      "note": "Complete one course at the 2010-2499 level by the end of sophomore year. Listed options are GERST 2020, 2040, 2060 or equivalent; equivalencies need department review. The preparatory sequence is GERST 1210, GERST 1220, GERST 1230, GERST 2000-2009, then GERST 2010-2499. These are preparation, not additional major coursework rows. Placement after GERST 1220 determines GERST 1230 or GERST 2000; advanced standing may require the CASE exam."
